/target/

# Deliberately NOT committed: the lockfile is generated fresh inside the Docker
# build (see runner-soroban/Dockerfile, which resolves it and then downgrades
# ed25519-dalek to 2.2.0). Anyone running cargo or `stellar contract build` in
# this directory locally produces one — ignoring it keeps that from being
# committed by accident and silently pinning the image to a stale graph.
/Cargo.lock
